WEBVTT

00:00:03.187 --> 00:00:06.491
Open Access Control, Roles and edit a role.

00:00:06.491 --> 00:00:09.390
Type Telephony in Search permissions:

00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:12.087
the module adds three permissions.

00:00:12.539 --> 00:00:16.300
Manage telephony settings opens the Telephony settings.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:19.999
Manage telephony extensions opens the extensions list.

00:00:20.451 --> 00:00:24.547
Use the telephony soft phone lets a person make and take calls.

00:00:24.547 --> 00:00:28.762
Only the Administrator role has it by default, so add it to every

00:00:28.762 --> 00:00:30.721
role that works the phones.

